flowchart TD
    U[User question or receipt or travel request] --> I[Validate input and load authorized session]
    I --> ROUTE{Route by request type}
    ROUTE -->|Simple policy question| Q[Clarify applicability if needed]
    Q --> QR[Shared policy retrieval service]
    QR --> QA[Generate answer and validate citations]
    QA --> OUT[Answer or clarification with evidence]
    ROUTE -->|Receipt review| RP[Planner and executor]
    RP --> PARSE[Vision or permitted OCR]
    PARSE --> CONF[Pause for critical field confirmation]
    CONF --> RR[Shared policy retrieval service]
    RR --> CALC[Python policy and budget calculator]
    CALC --> CRITIC[Critic checks evidence and tool outputs]
    ROUTE -->|Travel recommendation| SP[Planner and executor]
    SP --> API[Live flight or hotel search adapter]
    API --> SR[Shared policy retrieval service]
    SR --> FILTER[Python policy filtering and ranking]
    FILTER --> CRITIC
    CRITIC -->|Pass| OUT
    CRITIC -->|One repair allowed| REPAIR[Executor repairs identified issue]
    REPAIR --> CRITIC
    CRITIC -->|Unresolved or missing facts| OUT
    subgraph RETRIEVAL[Inside the shared retrieval service]
        F[Access and applicability filters] --> BM[BM25 keyword matching]
        F --> VS[Optional semantic vector search]
        BM --> MERGE[Rank fusion and deduplication]
        VS --> MERGE
        MERGE --> RE[Bounded same model reranking]
        RE --> EV[Evidence text and source IDs]
    end
